{"id": 4, "title": "Day 4", "topic": "Hello! Introducing yourself", "words": [{"kind": "phrase", "g": "x", "ru": "здра́вствуйте", "en": "hello (polite / to several people)", "pic": "waving_hand.png", "id": "d4w1", "audio": "2ea5d89158.mp3", "pr": "ZDRAST-vui-tye", "lemmas": ["здра́вствуйте"]}, {"kind": "phrase", "g": "x", "ru": "приве́т", "en": "hi (to a friend)", "pic": "grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes.png", "id": "d4w2", "audio": "fcd886436c.mp3", "pr": "pri-VYET", "lemmas": ["приве́т"]}, {"kind": "phrase", "g": "x", "ru": "меня́ зову́т…", "en": "my name is… (lit. they call me)", "pic": "name_badge.png", "say": "Меня́ зову́т.", "id": "d4w3", "audio": "80e9916385.mp3", "pr": "mi-NYA -za-vut…", "lemmas": ["меня́ зову́т"]}, {"kind": "phrase", "g": "x", "ru": "как?", "en": "how? what (name)?", "pic": "thinking_face.png", "say": "Как?", "id": "d4w4", "audio": "6464d0e567.mp3", "pr": "kak?", "lemmas": ["как"]}, {"kind": "phrase", "g": "x", "ru": "о́чень прия́тно", "en": "nice to meet you", "pic": "handshake.png", "id": "d4w5", "audio": "cad06ee394.mp3", "pr": "O-chin' p-ri-yat-na", "lemmas": ["о́чень прия́тно"]}, {"kind": "phrase", "g": "x", "ru": "отку́да?", "en": "where from?", "pic": "globe_showing_europe-africa.png", "say": "Отку́да?", "id": "d4w6", "audio": "85e9f6bc53.mp3", "pr": "at-KU-da?", "lemmas": ["отку́да"]}, {"kind": "phrase", "g": "x", "ru": "спаси́бо", "en": "thank you", "pic": "folded_hands.png", "id": "d4w7", "audio": "7cd62b96ac.mp3", "pr": "spa-SI-ba", "lemmas": ["спаси́бо"]}, {"kind": "phrase", "g": "x", "ru": "пожа́луйста", "en": "please · you're welcome", "pic": "smiling_face_with_smiling_eyes.png", "id": "d4w8", "audio": "b3d6a525b2.mp3", "pr": "pa-ZHA-lus-ta", "lemmas": ["пожа́луйста"]}, {"kind": "phrase", "g": "x", "ru": "извини́те", "en": "excuse me · sorry (polite)", "pic": "raising_hands.png", "id": "d4w9", "audio": "ceeb1fe302.mp3", "pr": "iz-vi-NI-tye", "lemmas": ["извини́те"]}, {"kind": "phrase", "g": "x", "ru": "до свида́ния", "en": "goodbye", "pic": "door.png", "id": "d4w10", "audio": "f2b7db76cf.mp3", "pr": "da s-vi-DA-ni-ya", "lemmas": ["до свида́ния"]}, {"kind": "phrase", "g": "x", "ru": "пока́", "en": "bye (to a friend)", "pic": "victory_hand.png", "id": "d4w11", "audio": "6696b6847e.mp3", "pr": "pa-KA", "lemmas": ["пока́"]}], "sentences": [{"word": "d4w1", "ru": "Здра́вствуйте!", "en": "Hello!", "pics": ["waving_hand.png"], "id": "d4s1", "audio": "e6f6165a16.mp3", "pr": "ZDRAST-vui-tye"}, {"word": "d4w1", "ru": "Здра́вствуйте, как вас зову́т?", "en": "Hello, what is your name? (polite)", "pics": ["waving_hand.png", "name_badge.png"], "id": "d4s2", "audio": "67643e6fe3.mp3", "pr": "ZDRAST-vui-tye kak vas za-VUT"}, {"word": "d4w2", "ru": "Приве́т! Как дела́?", "en": "Hi! How are you?", "pics": ["waving_hand.png", "grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes.png"], "id": "d4s3", "audio": "041b3f6704.mp3", "pr": "pri-VYET kak di-LA"}, {"word": "d4w2", "ru": "Хорошо́, спаси́бо. А у тебя́?", "en": "Good, thanks. And you?", "pics": ["thumbs_up.png", "speech_balloon.png"], "id": "d4s4", "audio": "b1d1ab4b9c.mp3", "pr": "kha-ra-SHO spa-SI-ba a u ti-BYA"}, {"word": "d4w3", "ru": "Меня́ зову́т Ива́н.", "en": "My name is Ivan.", "pics": ["man.png", "name_badge.png"], "id": "d4s5", "audio": "81670a2e82.mp3", "pr": "mi-NYA za-VUT i-VAN"}, {"word": "d4w3", "ru": "Меня́ зову́т А́нна.", "en": "My name is Anna.", "pics": ["woman.png", "name_badge.png"], "id": "d4s6", "audio": "58c9237497.mp3", "pr": "mi-NYA za-VUT A-na"}, {"word": "d4w4", "ru": "Как тебя́ зову́т?", "en": "What's your name? (to a friend)", "pics": ["thinking_face.png", "name_badge.png"], "id": "d4s7", "audio": "5f6526830b.mp3", "pr": "kak ti-BYA za-VUT"}, {"word": "d4w4", "ru": "Как вас зову́т?", "en": "What is your name? (polite)", "pics": ["thinking_face.png", "name_badge.png"], "id": "d4s8", "audio": "5a2718625f.mp3", "pr": "kak vas za-VUT"}, {"word": "d4w5", "ru": "О́чень прия́тно!", "en": "Nice to meet you!", "pics": ["handshake.png"], "id": "d4s9", "audio": "651a625a0f.mp3", "pr": "O-chin' pri-YAT-na"}, {"word": "d4w5", "ru": "Мне то́же о́чень прия́тно.", "en": "Nice to meet you too.", "pics": ["handshake.png", "smiling_face_with_smiling_eyes.png"], "id": "d4s10", "audio": "16f028595c.mp3", "pr": "mnye TO-zhe O-chin' pri-YAT-na"}, {"word": "d4w6", "ru": "Отку́да вы?", "en": "Where are you from? (polite)", "pics": ["globe_showing_europe-africa.png", "red_question_mark.png"], "id": "d4s11", "audio": "30f1cfe5c4.mp3", "pr": "at-KU-da vih"}, {"word": "d4w6", "ru": "Отку́да ты?", "en": "Where are you from? (to a friend)", "pics": ["globe_showing_europe-africa.png", "red_question_mark.png"], "id": "d4s12", "audio": "099753837e.mp3", "pr": "at-KU-da tih"}, {"word": "d4w7", "ru": "Спаси́бо большо́е!", "en": "Thank you very much!", "pics": ["folded_hands.png", "red_heart.png"], "id": "d4s13", "audio": "606f70bc1b.mp3", "pr": "spa-SI-ba bal'-SHO-ye"}, {"word": "d4w8", "ru": "Ко́фе, пожа́луйста.", "en": "A coffee, please.", "pics": ["hot_beverage.png"], "id": "d4s14", "audio": "20ff108edc.mp3", "pr": "KO-fye pa-ZHA-lus-ta"}, {"word": "d4w8", "ru": "Спаси́бо! — Пожа́луйста!", "en": "Thank you! — You're welcome!", "pics": ["folded_hands.png", "smiling_face_with_smiling_eyes.png"], "id": "d4s15", "audio": "9ca2f34be4.mp3", "pr": "spa-SI-ba pa-ZHA-lus-ta"}, {"word": "d4w9", "ru": "Извини́те, где метро́?", "en": "Excuse me, where is the metro?", "pics": ["raising_hands.png", "metro.png"], "id": "d4s16", "audio": "d32f6f8f06.mp3", "pr": "iz-vi-NI-tye gdye mit-RO"}, {"word": "d4w10", "ru": "До свида́ния! До за́втра!", "en": "Goodbye! See you tomorrow!", "pics": ["door.png", "spiral_calendar.png"], "id": "d4s17", "audio": "d05daf6343.mp3", "pr": "do svi-DA-ni-ya do ZAVT-ra"}, {"word": "d4w11", "ru": "Пока́! До ве́чера!", "en": "Bye! See you tonight!", "pics": ["victory_hand.png", "night_with_stars.png"], "id": "d4s18", "audio": "93d587f522.mp3", "pr": "pa-KA do VYE-chi-ra"}, {"mk": "Я из {Ли́ви|и}.", "g": "f", "case": "из + genitive", "en": "I'm from Libya.", "pics": ["globe_showing_europe-africa.png"], "id": "d4s19", "ru": "Я из Ли́вии.", "audio": "28ae1cac54.mp3", "pr": "ya is LI-vi-i"}, {"mk": "Он из {Росси́|и}.", "g": "f", "case": "из + genitive", "en": "He is from Russia.", "pics": ["man.png", "globe_showing_europe-africa.png"], "id": "d4s20", "ru": "Он из Росси́и.", "audio": "1871b90850.mp3", "pr": "on is ra-SI-i"}, {"mk": "Она́ из {Ла́тви|и}.", "g": "f", "case": "из + genitive", "en": "She is from Latvia.", "pics": ["woman.png", "globe_showing_europe-africa.png"], "id": "d4s21", "ru": "Она́ из Ла́твии.", "audio": "f536dae105.mp3", "pr": "a-NA is LAT-vi-i"}, {"mk": "Мы из {Кана́д|ы}.", "g": "f", "case": "из + genitive", "en": "We are from Canada.", "pics": ["globe_showing_americas.png"], "id": "d4s22", "ru": "Мы из Кана́ды.", "audio": "ada5787bd9.mp3", "pr": "mih is ka-NA-dih"}, {"mk": "Я живу́ в {Ри́г|е}.", "g": "f", "case": "в + prepositional (where?)", "en": "I live in Riga.", "pics": ["cityscape.png", "house.png"], "id": "d4s23", "ru": "Я живу́ в Ри́ге.", "audio": "b67efaf1f5.mp3", "pr": "ya zhi-VU v RI-gye"}, {"mk": "Я студе́нт. Я учу́сь в {университе́т|е}.", "g": "m", "case": "в + prepositional (where?)", "en": "I'm a student. I study at university.", "pics": ["graduation_cap.png", "books.png"], "id": "d4s24", "ru": "Я студе́нт. Я учу́сь в университе́те.", "audio": "a4a9ad82b9.mp3", "pr": "ya stu-DYENT ya u-CHUS' v u-ni-vir-si-TYE-tye"}], "notes": [{"h": "ты or вы?", "lines": ["ты (tih): one friend, family, a child. Приве́т! Как тебя́ зову́т? Отку́да ты?", "вы (vih): a stranger, a teacher, older people, or more than one person. Здра́вствуйте! Как вас зову́т? Отку́да вы?", "When in doubt, use вы: it is never rude."]}, {"h": "Saying your name", "lines": ["Меня́ зову́т… means “they call me…”. меня́ (me) is the accusative of я.", "Asking: Как тебя́ зову́т? (friend) · Как вас зову́т? (polite). тебя́ and вас are the accusative of ты and вы."]}, {"h": "Where are you from?", "lines": ["из + genitive: Ли́вия → из Ли́вии, Росси́я → из Росси́и, Ла́твия → из Ла́твии, Кана́да → из Кана́ды.", "Countries in -ия change -я to -и. Countries in -а change -а to -ы (Day 2 genitive!)."]}, {"h": "Where do you live?", "lines": ["в + prepositional: Ри́га → в Ри́ге, Москва́ → в Москве́, университе́т → в университе́те.", "But countries in -ия take -ии: в Росси́и, в Ли́вии, в Ла́твии."]}, {"h": "Polite little words", "lines": ["пожа́луйста means both “please” and “you're welcome”.", "Как дела́? = How are you? Answers: хорошо́ (good), норма́льно (OK), пло́хо (bad).", "здра́вствуйте: the first в is silent, so you say ZDRAST-vui-tye."]}], "video": "videos/day4.mp4"}